  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the chwinamul under cold water and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "Heat the robata grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the lemon juice, garlic, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture onto the chwinamul, making sure it's evenly coated.",
    "Place the chwinamul on the robata grill and cook for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "After 8 minutes of cooking, brush the chwinamul with olive oil.",
    "Continue cooking for an additional 2-4 minutes, until the chwinamul is tender and slightly charred.",
    "Remove the chwinamul from the grill and let it rest for a few minutes before serving."
  ],
